  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Initiative to Strengthen the National and Development Partners&#x2019; Gender Equality Coordination Mechanisms in Tanzania: For strengthening the functionality of both existing and new coordination structures for development partners (DPG Gender and Gender Macro Working Group) and for government in relation to three key national frameworks (the NPA-VAWC, TGEP and TNAP WPS). It will also strengthen linkages and collaboration between the coordination structures of these frameworks within the Ministries of Gender in both Mainland and Zanzibar.</narrative>
  </description>
